to: recipe-tester
topic: opening-menu-validation

Use shared/menu-direction.md and shared/menu-draft.md as binding. Review the
menu now, then repeat the review after shared/pastry-development.md and
shared/sauce-development.md are available.

Audit the exact dish and category counts, tasting progression, repeated primary
ingredients, vegetarian count, dairy-free adaptability, allergen coverage,
contrast, citrus adjacency, smoke fatigue, cross-utilization, pickup complexity,
holding risks, and likely bottlenecks. Recommend specific corrections, not
general observations.

Write the full deliverable to shared/menu-validation.md and return it in the
handoff message to head-chef with topic opening-menu-validation.
